Revision history for NWC2MusicXML

0.01  2026-09-16
      - Initial scaffold generated.
      - NWC2MusicXML::NWC    -- binary container decoder (stub; Phase 1).
      - NWC2MusicXML::Parser -- NWCTXT parser (stub; Phase 2).
      - NWC2MusicXML::Score  -- internal score IR.
      - NWC2MusicXML::Staff  -- internal staff IR.
      - NWC2MusicXML::Event  -- internal event IR with rational duration arithmetic.
      - NWC2MusicXML::MusicXML -- MusicXML generator (stub; Phase 3).
      - NWC2MusicXML::Diagnostics -- warning/logging subsystem.
      - NWC2MusicXML    -- top-level facade and batch converter.
      - bin/nwc2musicxml  -- command-line interface.
      - t/00-load.t       -- module load tests.
      - t/10-nwc.t        -- NWC container decoder tests.
      - t/20-parser.t     -- NWCTXT parser tests.
      - t/30-musicxml.t   -- MusicXML generator tests.
